# Rig calibration curves, and the manifest naming them, are measurement data:
# a calibration measured on a clone rig belongs to whoever measured it, not to
# this repository. Everything here is ignored except the documented example, so
# a stray `git add -A` cannot publish someone's calibration curves.
data_deltas/*
!data_deltas/README.md
!data_deltas/delta_targets.example.json
